#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/_apply_license.html:5
msgid ""
"Install a license you bought from the vendor into the database of this "
"instance. It replaces the edition the instance runs now; the instance is not"
" restarted."
msgstr "把您从厂商购买的许可证装入本实例的数据库。它会替换实例当前运行的版本，实例不会重启。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/_apply_license.html:6
msgid ""
"What the database then reports about its license is on the Licenses tab of "
"the instance."
msgstr "装入后数据库报告的许可证信息，可以在实例的\"许可证\"标签页查看。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/_apply_license.html:7
