#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/upgrade/_upgrade_instance.html:7
msgid "Important: upgrading an instance can result in data loss."
msgstr "重要：升级实例可能导致数据丢失。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/upgrade/_upgrade_instance.html:10
msgid "Make sure you have a full backup of the database before starting the upgrade."
msgstr "开始升级前，请确保已有数据库的完整备份。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/upgrade/_upgrade_instance.html:13
msgid ""
"Downgrading to an earlier version is possible using this form, but the "
"database system may not support downgrades."
msgstr "可以用这个表单降级到更早的版本，但数据库系统本身可能不支持降级。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/upgrade/_upgrade_instance.html:16
msgid ""
"Some upgrades may not complete successfully without a logical backup. Please"
" refer to the upgrade guidelines for the corresponding database version."
msgstr "某些升级不做逻辑备份可能无法顺利完成。请参阅对应数据库版本的升级指南。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/upgrade/_upgrade_instance.html:19
msgid ""
"We recommend testing the upgrade process on a test instance before upgrading"
" a production database."
msgstr "建议先在测试实例上演练升级，再升级生产数据库。"

#: trove_dashboard/content/databases/templates/databases/upgrade/_upgrade_instance.html:22
msgid ""
"Upgrading to the same version may be useful when the version tag points to a"
" newer database image, for example after a security update. Such upgrades "
"are usually safe."
msgstr "当版本标签指向更新的数据库镜像时（例如安全更新之后），升级到同一版本会有用。这类升级通常是安全的。"

